es":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"M0YuK7sLLSA3TfBC4UkUzg","review_id":"Mu9LBtB6PI6bSNhjqYDrsA","date":"2015-05-11T16:08:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9461344480514526,"text_excerpt":"Give me bread or give me death. Croissant D'Or Patisserie is THE mecca of yummy croissants and pastries. Fresh, made in-house, delicious, buttery dough filled with your choice of decadent sweetness. I am extremely indecisive and love to be a fatass whenever given the option so naturally I ordered one of each. (I did share, ok!) Out of the apple, raspberry, chocolate and almond my favorite was the raspberry. However, I would be happy if I woke up and any of those croissants were magically in my kitchen. My iced coffee and milk did not need a grain of sugar, it was already smooth and delicious. Since I am a bit of a history buff I am completely enthralled of the interior of this place (form..."},{"business_id":"M0YuK7sLLSA3TfBC4UkUzg","review_id":"LpISSx9HBQLhIWRi3PsfBA","date":"2010-10-06T01:34:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9421865940093994,"text_excerpt":"My new favorite breakfast/pastry spot in New Orleans! I love everything about this place...the nice quiet location, the old charming tile interior, and of course... croissants! I got hooked on the chocolate croissants, but my partner loved the apple croissant as well. The cafe au lait is stellar...a great way to start the day! The baguettes looked so awesome that we bought a sandwich to go; the sandwich was a little light on meat but the cheese & bread were good. Others were recommending the quiches, but I couldn't get past the croissants.Plenty of table space so you don't feel rushed...every morning there feels liked a laid-back Sunday. Closed on Tuesdays."},{"business_id":"M0YuK7sLLSA3TfBC4UkUzg","review_id":"-GK5H02EM1hw9f3FTrtmOg","date":"2014-05-23T15:13:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9410676956176758,"text_excerpt":"This place is a ridiculously cute little french cafe. I just had a croissant but my boyfriend got the breakfast special and I'm not going to lie, it was pretty tasty. I really love the little window seating. It's the perfect place to start your morning. Although I didn't try the pastries or the quiches they looked really good. Who knows we may be back here for breakfast again before we head back home."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"M0YuK7sLLSA3TfBC4UkUzg","photo_id":"sprgZGcIre1szsE6aDLyiA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/sprgZGcIre1szsE6aDLyiA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8564878106117249},{"business_id":"M0YuK7sLLSA3TfBC4UkUzg","photo_id":"SONaUULyqQJOTAjR7qXlBA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SONaUULyqQJOTAjR7qXlBA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8559131026268005},{"business_id":"M0YuK7sLLSA3TfBC4UkUzg","photo_id":"e7ccLcmGMiYnzfCX76MFxw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/e7ccLcmGMiYnzfCX76MFxw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8422442674636841},{"business_id":"M0YuK7sLLSA3TfBC4UkUzg","photo_id":"gNTWkweQBq0artoqJ8IoSg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/gNTWkweQBq0artoqJ8IoSg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8288801312446594},{"business_id":"M0YuK7sLLSA3TfBC4UkUzg","photo_id":"Wkp4ymYDt0l3h9dPCsiI_Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Wkp4ymYDt0l3h9dPCsiI_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7992715239524841}]},"notebook_case":null}
